private ThemeInfo? Theme { get; set; }
```

**Rules:**
- Matched by **type**, not name. To cascade multiple values of the same type, add `Name`:
  ```razor
  <CascadingValue Value="primary" Name="PrimaryTheme">...</CascadingValue>
  ```
